step Senani Thunderheart
  when !turnedin 6383
  tip Senani Thunderheart keeps the hunt board at Night Run, by the flight master: take The Ashenvale Hunt and hand it straight back. Ursangous, Sharptalon and Shadumbra drop their trophies only after it.
  turnin 6383 direct

step Splintertree Post
