step Felmusk satyrs
  tip North-west of Splintertree, the Felmusk satyrs camp in the woods. Every satyr can drop horns. Careful: Felmusk Rogues and Shadowstalkers move in stealth and join fights without warning.
  collect 5481 quest 6441

step Shadumbra
  when turnedin 6383
  tip Shadumbra, a shadow panther, stalks the woods around Raynewood Retreat, west of the Felmusk camp. Her head starts the next hunt quest.
  collect 16304
  accept 24 item 16304

step Laughing Sisters
  when onquest 1195
  tip The Laughing Sisters, dryads, wander Raynewood Retreat around Shadumbra's woods; one of them drops Zangen's Etched Phial, which can take several kills.
  collect 5867 @59.0,56.1             -- Etched Phial, from a Laughing Sister

step Ashenvale Moonwell
  when onquest 1195
  tip South from Raynewood, the moonwell sits in a hollow west of the river, hard to see from the road; Mystral Lake is west of it. Use the Etched Phial at the moonwell to fill it.
  use 5867 quest 1195.1 @60.2,72.9                 -- Etched Phial, at the Ashenvale Moonwell
  collect 5868 quest 1195

step Tideress
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Back south-west to Mystral Lake. Tideress, a corrupted water elemental, drifts around the lake's island and under the water. She drops the Befouled Water Globe only once you have Stonetalon Standstill from Mastok; it starts a quest for Splintertree.
  collect 16408
  accept 1918 item 16408

step Mystral Lake
  tip Befouled Water Elementals drift around the lake's shores; the gazebo stands on the island, overlooking the Alliance outpost.
  kill 3917 quest 25.1                -- Underwater
  goto 48.9,69.6 "Gazebo"
  complete 25

