step The Earthen Ring
  zone Mulgore
  tip The Earthen Ring camp stands north of the bluffs: Mazu'kon, Yorn Grimtotem and Muln Earthfury. From Thunder Bluff, take a lift down; coming on foot from Camp Taurajo, keep north past the bluffs.
  accept 96260                        -- Yorn Grimtotem
  accept 96241 @32.5,20.6 live        -- Mazu'kon
