step Gloomrise: kill these as you meet them
  zone Mulgore
  tip North of the camp, spiders overrun the burial ground at Gloomrise. Use Mazu'kon's Toxin Extractor on the Gnawed Corpses; the Spinners drop the Crystalline Silk. Broodmother Valraxx (30, elite) sits at the north end: leave her unless you do The Broodmother with a group; her Bloody Parchment starts A Darker Truth.
  collect 273181 quest 96260.1        -- Crystalline Silk, from Gloomrise Spinners
  kill 264083 quest 96259.2
  kill 264079 quest 96259.1
  collect 273001 quest 96241.1        -- Gloomrise Toxin Samples, from the Gnawed Corpses

