step Tear of the Moons
  zone The Barrens
  tip On the road south to the Great Lift, turn east into the Bael Modan dig. Feegly the Exiled hides at its south edge. General Twinbraid's Strongbox stands on the bottom floor of the dwarves' fortress, beside General Twinbraid (30) and his Officers (26): pull them to you one at a time.
  accept 857                          -- Feegly the Exiled
  collect 5038 quest 857 @49.1,84.3   -- General Twinbraid's Strongbox; below ground
  turnin 857

