  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Grish Longrunner and Brave Moonhorn wait at the top of the Great Lift: Maggran's letter is for Grish, and Moonhorn's message goes down to Freewind Post with you.
  goto 31.9,23.9 "The Great Lift, down into Thousand Needles"
  turnin 5881                         -- Grish Longrunner
