step Alien Egg
  tip Take the lift down. The egg lies in a nest on the canyon floor in one of three spots: south-east of the mesas (52.3,55.2), east (56.4,50.4) or south-west (37.6,56.1).
  collect 12467 quest 4821 @37.6,56.1 map 1441

step Galak centaurs
  tip The Galak camps fill the canyon north of Freewind; Scouts, Wranglers and Windchasers share every camp. A lone Galak Messenger walks a long path between the camps: if you meet him, kill him, his note starts a quest for Whitereach Post. Don't wait for him. Careful: storm elementals roam the canyon floor around the camps: Stormheart (30), the Ravaging Tempests (40) and Ailgrha Splittusk (38), all elite. Keep clear of them.
  kill 4094 quest 4841.1
  kill 4093 quest 4841.2
  kill 4096 quest 4841.3
  collect 12564 optional              -- Galak Messenger's Assassination Plot, if you meet him
  accept 4881 item 12564 optional

step Splithoof Hold
  when onquest 1197
  tip A short walk north of the Galak camps, the cave of Splithoof Hold leads down to its deepest chamber, where the Ancient Brazier burns. Use the Filled Etched Phial on it, then loot the Cloven Hoof at once: the flame only stays out briefly, and if it relights the phial is gone. Then east to Dorn's mesa.
  tip Careful: Two Galak Flame Guards (30) stand by the brazier and a centaur guard walks the cave: pull them away one at a time before you douse the flame.
  use 5868 quest 1197.1 @42.0,31.5                 -- Filled Etched Phial, at the Ancient Brazier
  collect 5869 quest 1197 @42.0,31.5  -- Cloven Hoof, from the Ancient Brazier

step Dorn Plainstalker
  tip Dorn Plainstalker stands on a mesa top east of the Galak camps. For the Test of Faith, walk off the end of the planks beside him: you land safely.
  accept 1149                         -- Dorn Plainstalker, below ground
  complete 1149
  turnin 1149
  accept 1150

