step Rok'Alim the Pounder
  tip Rok'Alim, a hard-hitting rock elemental, walks the cliffs of Highperch, back west past Whitereach Post. Rok'Alim the Pounder is elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 5844 quest 1151 optional
  turnin 1151 optional                -- Dorn Plainstalker, below ground

step Freewind Post
  tip Back to Freewind Post. The Mirage Raceway's quests come with the next visit to the Shimmering Flats, at 33.
  note The next guide flies on from here to the Crossroads and Orgrimmar.
